From 9942c9f5bd767416b10b7744c38eb9d255e78546 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Remora <remora@localhost>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 22:08:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] A17: Remora c2-va enablement for the VAAPI Codec2 path

Carries the four Remora changes from the A16 tree (range 9b9aa23..HEAD there),
re-applied onto A17's newer 26Q2 base and squashed, since c2-va is staged as a
source tree rather than tracked per-commit:

  * VAAPI HEVC encoder path - adds VideoEncoder::handlesInputFormatConversion,
    the hook c2-va's encoder needs (and the compile blocker without it)
  * decoder CPU_READ linear gralloc allocation
  * DecodeComponent configUpdate picture-size handling
  * EncodeComponent max-fps drop

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I8adad1f5d5f93e14643dfb39df3089e1b01e8c1d
