+// Vendor tuning: encoder-side max-fps cap (bd remora-rjh). The SDK's KEY_MAX_FPS_TO_ENCODER
+// only ever configures the framework's InputSurface — no standard C2 param delivers it to a
+// component — so clients (the mirror agent) set the SDK-visible "vendor.remora-max-fps.value"
